  "definition": "Revocation of Waiver",
  "effectiveDate": "2023-07-17",
  "historyNote": "#8404, eff 8-2-05 (from Saf-C 908.13); ss by #10215, eff 10-25-12; ss by #13684, eff 7-17-23",
